{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48823","headline":"送刘南史往杭州拜觐别驾叔 · 刘商","name":"送刘南史往杭州拜觐别驾叔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兄弟飘零自长年，见君眉白转相怜。\n清扬似玉须勤学，富贵由人不在天。\n万里榛芜迷旧国，两河烽火复相连。\n林中若使题书信，但问漳滨访客船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}